          "id": 2618848715,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Call `mainApp->helpTopicAction()` from the filter toolbar (add Help to the context menu?) or clickable item in status bar?  \n  \nThere is a request (#20620) for an alias where the original should not be marked deprecated. If that gets added then the WSUG section would be renamed \"Filter Aliases\" and that could be the section to visit in the deprecated message. The \"Filter Aliases\" section might have a blurb about non-deprecated filters and also include all the existing text related to deprecated filters.",
